[[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before starting the removal operations, make a note of the position of the knob.</p></aside><p>1.Release the cover (1a) from the knob (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194001478.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,1,0,"<p>1.Undo the bolt (1a) and release the knob (1b) and keep the disc (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/194001479.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>-Position the disc and fit the knob.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Fit the knob in the position noted previously during the removal.</p></aside><p>- Carefully tighten the bolt and fit the cover on the knob.</p>"]]